{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：21:27 2026-11-25 HKT<br/>發佈時間：21:27 2026-11-25 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：21:27 2026-11-25 HKT</p><img alt=\"「飛躍成就」賀賢起孖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/788aa195d696d49cac84e7b94c861bad/2026-11/r5_6.jpg\"/><p>過往在港上陣十七次，未嘗一勝的賀廄「飛躍成就」，今晚回師曾上名的谷草千二米，改配周俊樂及重戴眼罩，終於在直路擊敗「莊家班」，贏得在港首場頭馬，同時捧走聖安度挑戰碟，練馬師賀賢今晚亦起孖。</p><p>賀賢今晚搏殺手風甚順，繼頭場「頌星」後贏馬，第五場 四班千二米以周俊樂策騎的「飛躍成就」勝出兼捧走聖安度挑戰碟。</p><p>賽後賀賢說：「『飛躍成就』並非只擅跑快活谷，沙田也可以應付，由於貼內欄不太理想，因此周俊樂移出中間守好位，馬兒之前曾經五度跑得第二名，今場終於取勝，我認為牠沒有千六米長力，氣量限於千四米。」</p><h2>按下圖睇更多相片：</h2><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/6d4438fd8e1b2ccbf10adedfa4f4c41a/2026-11/1bfc5f4a-5cc0-438b-9bdf-283672dc83b4.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/29299bfb1737c227db83ee806bb349db/2026-11/1fa07e61-c62f-4501-bbfd-4add0dccf7e3.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/aadfe6e5199805cf842cd4121692174b/2026-11/2b4e7999-ad41-4c8a-96aa-2b1e451043f1.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/043867f4aecc3dfadfdd862a99dc6ca8/2026-11/4a97d67b-96f5-4a57-bea6-d098f70dba49.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/9d02688d85c4dd1eb21e532c3ee07cd0/2026-11/5a193f47-1240-4c2f-a050-629d361f1206.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e570bbb276cbcd9a8491012fb5b57e90/2026-11/6e9af7c7-9286-47fb-9ad5-c4971ab25350.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c9406842f569204d44e41411a42b09ac/2026-11/67f2e477-7d82-4263-ab95-02482c036e74.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/f8d8d965742e51df515542ec0d07286a/2026-11/099f4f81-3ead-49ed-a6e1-41eb0222c723.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/dba129f9d17132c6e4d2195c79c7a08a/2026-11/9275a302-b864-4a6d-9406-f1c04f3845ea.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ec851cb964e88a5132a5ba2118942238/2026-11/72517b41-ad05-437e-bfc8-c05bdc118a0c.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c5e6243e4024875290b22a1001aa4298/2026-11/4216645e-3008-4066-9429-c02e5ab687d8.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/93b86b694ba3ae0e0e994678afc282e2/2026-11/69350217-8a97-4610-af80-fbc31fc6d136.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e24eb3f960935a5faeb556360acd9893/2026-11/d01cf5fd-c1a4-48fd-aa55-c3f62cfe2042.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/9797dc6b5c5135c46874859193f49fd5/2026-11/e211bcbe-783d-4e56-904c-10fa5354edf8.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/589950ede66377a347b9c58f7bfcab75/2026-11/e560ae28-c7ff-4116-bf17-1a4562d0df99.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/82372e6a1e06bdf912c8d5d718361d7a/2026-11/e3135f6b-30a5-4e89-aec2-bfbda17c40d4.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/83ae070e5cd671e1880bf2ea21a65529/2026-11/eb66390d-f9d5-4017-ae8a-f6b455f56f6e.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/446ab4199ecbe6d04c236d5ae42ec6cb/2026-11/f1fd132f-7d49-4806-ac95-56704a2dcddc.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T13:43:56.761053+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":339,"images":19,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T13:27:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T22:50:31.739396+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T13:37:28.039532+00:00","content_hash":"aab36c35ca728c08a3a6a940de814b5bea2ed21345280f175b1299b94358d21d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}